            <div xml:id="d167">

                <pb facs="0294" n="204" sameAs="frus:frus1920v02/pg204"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">422.11G93/1154 1/2</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Ecuador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hartman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Quito</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-12-20"><hi rendition="#italic">December 20,
                        1920</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received January 15, 1921.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 624</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to confirm my telegram No.
                    84 of December 18, 12 noon,<anchor n="32" xml:id="d167-f1"/> reporting total
                    deposits as of December 15, 1920, on account of service of Guayaquil &amp; Quito
                    Railway bonds, and Salt Certificates. The exact amounts of such deposits follow:
                        <table cols="2" rows="2">
                        <row>
                            <cell rend="padding-left: 2em;">For service of Guayaquil &amp; Quito
                                Railway bonds</cell>
                            <cell role="num">S/.404,954.47</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell rend="padding-left: 2em;">For Salt Certificates</cell>
                            <cell role="num">93,866.40</cell>
                        </row>
                    </table></p>
                <p>I further report that no remittances to London have been made.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chas. S. Hartman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
